  ('DLAB-D1524R', 'DLAB D1524R High Speed Refrigerated Micro Centrifuge', 'dlab-d1524r-high-speed-refrigerated-micro-centrifuge', 'DLAB High Speed Refrigerated Micro Centrifuge.', '[["Model", "D1524R"]]', '["| Specifications | D1524R Electronic Magnetic door locking system - the lid Max. Speed in 100rpm increments", "Precooling, the compressor automatically starts cooling as long as the set temperature is lower than 36×0.2/0.5mL，24×1.5/2mL， the ambient temperature 4×0.2mL PCR 8-tube strip， Capacity 12×5mL (cone bottom)", "Sound indicator at the end of running. 18×5mL (round bottom)", "Temperature range -20℃ to 40℃", "Short pre-cooling time of only 7minutes from room", "Up to 9 program storage capacity | Motor Type | Brushless DC motor", "3-layer sealed rotors ensure safe centifugation | Dual door lock, over-speed detection", "High-strength aluminum alloy rotor can be fully with Internal diagnosis system. autoclavable at 121℃ Single-phase，100-120V/200-240V", "Rotor imbalance detection alarm | Power Requirements 50Hz/60Hz.500W", "Adjustable acceleration/deceleration at 9 levels allows gentle braking at low speed for better separation", "Five rotors with 0.2mL, 0.5mL, 1.5mL, 2mL and 5mL Rotation speed/RCF switchover, processindicator", "| Other functions Adjustable acceleration/deceleration accumulation within centrifuge chamber at 9 levels program storage capacity"]', 'equipment', '/products/dlab/p164.jpg'),
